    "interpretation": "Direct std means bind_namespace calls whose argument route begins with std, including nested calls. Counters belong to the innermost active reference call. Hits reuse canonical declaration IDs; misses create fresh specialization metadata, not necessarily materialized bodies. Whole-namespace reuse returns before these counters. Aliases and indirect std dependencies are not attributed to direct std. This run measures existing reuse, not the speedup versus disabling reuse."
